                                          BUSINESS QUESTION
Which stocks are the most volatile?

                                       Query
SELECT 
	name,
	MAX(high)high_price,
	MIN(low)low_price,
	ROUND(
	  MAX(high-low),2)price_drop
FROM stock_data
GROUP BY name
ORDER BY price_drop DESC;


Insight:
From the data AMZN had the highest price movement than the rest of the stock in the dataset showing that its unstable and leading to  more market fluctuation 
and more investment risk


Recommendation
Highly volatile stocks should be monitored carefully because large price swings can create both high return opportunities and significant investment losses
